    "Scientific artivist based in Berlin. Tobias Eder brings psychological research and artistic practice together through public interventions, participatory installations, and sculptures made from discarded materials.":"Scientific artivist in Berlin. Tobias Eder verbindet psychologische Forschung und künstlerische Praxis durch öffentliche Interventionen, partizipative Installationen und Skulpturen aus weggeworfenen Materialien.",
